    "name":  "LED Controller 3-in-1 RGB + RGBW + RGBCCT - RF 2.4 GHz - 12-24V",
    "reference":  "FL7375-E3-RF",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e3-in-1 LED Controller (2.4 GHz)\u003c/strong\u003e is an efficient device for managing LED lights, standout for its tool-free installation and compatibility with Mi-Light/MiBoxer remotes. It offers a control range of up to 30 meters and allows brightness and color temperature adjustments. With a button, you can switch between RGB, RGBW, and RGB+CCT modes, providing flexible and customized lighting.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Controller 3-in-1 RGB + RGBW + RGBCCT - RF 2.4 GHz\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 3-in-1 LED Controller (2.4 GHz) is a versatile device designed for efficient flexible LED lighting management.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstant Tool-Free Wiring:\u003c/strong\u003e Quick easy installation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMi-Light/MiBoxer Remote Compatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e 2.4 GHz, fluid integration.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e30m Control Distance:\u003c/strong\u003e Wide range operation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdjustable Brightness and Color Temperature:\u003c/strong\u003e Complete personalization.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Mode Switching:\u003c/strong\u003e Toggle between RGB, RGBW, and RGB+CCT modes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIdeal for advanced easy-to-use LED lighting control.\u003c/p\u003e",
